"P4231913954" "Alright, the Family has got some problems down at the docks. It seems those Scrapyarders have been riling up the dockworkers, causing all kinds of grief for the Family there. The Family would normally just bust a few heads to solve the problem, but they want to be a bit more discreet-like. I need you to <A HREF={ACCEPT}>go down to the docks and bust up the dockworker's strike</A>."
