"P736084217" "Marcone's Defense"
// DetailString :
"P4247992353" "Falco Marcone relates that they were as mystified by the Verandi death as anyone. Some of Falco Marcone's men saw a guy sticking his nose around the warehouse before the Verandi death occurred! Falco managed to track the troublemaker to an old warehouse on the docks, but hadn't been able to find him yet."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3666320282" "We got us some Family problems. Y'see, there's two major families that are controllin' the docks, the Marcone and Verandi families. The Verandi family has recently experienced an untimely death, and certain clues point to the Marcone family as the perpetrators. The Verandis want to give the Marcones a warning that they are not to be messed with. <A HREF={ACCEPT}Head over to the Marcone warehouse and take out their boss</A>."
// AcceptString :
"P2231684533" "Take out the Marcone Family boss"
// SendOffString :
"P3143154598" "Let's show the Verandis that we need to keep things civil within the Family. Beat them down!"

